{
  "id": "tipred-1193-split-type-at-once",
  "priority": "P0",
  "title": "TIP RED 1193 red journey: the dogfood smoke gate's steps 1-23 exactly (3 workspaces with a line typed at once, then Cmd-D, d1 at once, Cmd-D, d2 at once); a pass counts only when the second Cmd-D and d2's keys took the hold path",
  "why": "TIP RED 1193 (STATUS 1202, 1226): on feat 5097a275a876 with the 15 GB hog the smoke gate's step 23 put d1 and d2 both in the FIRST new pane (2 of 3 rounds), with d1's keys held (debug.key handled_by \"app\"). The coordinator (11:2xZ): run the gate's step-23 path exactly (the typing of gate 851818b01b0) with the hold-path check, with the hog, on #29301's base and head builds. The steps are smoke-dogfood.json's steps 1-23 (unchanged, with 8a47689ab1a's left-to-right order assert). smoke_hold_path (the P0 owner's rule): the second Cmd-D (mark split2) and at least one key of each d2 line must be handled_by \"app\"; else the round is not run (hold path not proven). A failure of step 23 counts on any path.",
  "source": "journeys/dogfood/smoke-dogfood.json steps 1-23",
  "budget_seconds": 200,
  "steps": [
    {
      "do": "smoke_ready",
      "timeout": 60
    },
    {
      "do": "smoke_remember_workspaces"
    },
    {
      "do": "smoke_make_key"
    },
    {
      "do": "smoke_snapshot",
      "name": "before_workspaces"
    },
    {
      "do": "key",
      "key": "n",
      "modifiers": [
        "cmd"
      ],
      "mark": "ws1"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "title": "Cmd-N (1 of 3) makes a workspace; Ctrl-` follows as soon as it shows, at a person's speed (the frame kept: not blank)",
      "since": "ws1",
      "timeout": 20,
      "all": [
        {
          "smoke_workspaces": {
            "new": 1
          }
        },
        {
          "smoke_frame": {}
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "do": "key",
      "key": "`",
      "modifiers": [
        "control"
      ],
      "mark": "wsterm1"
    },
    {
      "do": "smoke_type_now",
      "text": "echo w1-${nonce}-$((6*7))"
    },
    {
      "do": "key",
      "key": "n",
      "modifiers": [
        "cmd"
      ],
      "mark": "ws2"
    },
    {
      "do": "expect",
      "title": "Cmd-N (2 of 3) makes a workspace; Ctrl-` follows as soon as it shows, at a person's speed (the frame kept: not blank)",
